infinite-patch 1
# Field: write a picture as a formula
node 1 Source FieldPixel
  id pix
  pos 0 340
  s code col = vec3(0.5 + 0.5 * sin(uv.x * 10.0 + t), 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(uv.y * 10.0 - t), 0.6);
end
node 2 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 500 156
end
node 3 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text Field lets you write your own picture, sound or shape in a few lines.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 4 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text Field draws each pixel from a formula. uv is the position, t is time. Double-click to open the editor and change the 10.0 values.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
cable out 0 pix
